  "bio": "Juninho Andrade (Jk) is a master of the watercolor tattoo style, creating vibrant and fluid designs that embody the essence of this artistic approach. Operating out of Johny Tattoo Studio in Belo Horizonte, Brazil, Juninho maintains the highest standard of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and sterile environment for each client who walks through the door. His commitment to a clean workspace is as clear as the bold colors in his tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Belo Horizonte, Minas Gerais, Brazil",
